00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:05,800
Your main account is gone. Can your team recover?

2
00:00:06,200 --> 00:00:11,800
Blackout Protocol maps your services, their owners, and what recovery depends on.

3
00:00:12,200 --> 00:00:19,800
Choose a loss. See which work stops and where recovery fails. Your real accounts stay unchanged.

4
00:00:20,200 --> 00:00:27,800
Prepare an independent way back. Keep it as a separate proposal. Assign the real preparation to its owner.

5
00:00:28,200 --> 00:00:35,800
Check the recovery order together. Missing prerequisites block simulated steps, so you can see what needs to change.

6
00:00:36,200 --> 00:00:40,800
Keep a readable recovery plan and an encrypted backup.

7
00:00:41,200 --> 00:00:44,800
Blackout Protocol. Prepare your way back.
